**Test** — `tests/test_jax_morph_hertzian.py`, `8 passed`. Eight properties all derived from the calculus of the energy (never from the oracle): analytic repulsive force magnitude, compact support (zero at/beyond contact), C2 soft vanishing, Newton's third law (Σforces=0), size-consistency, external dead-cell masking, arithmetic-mean epsilon, and finite autodiff gradients.

